          "reviewer_note": "The verified r1 capture has no GMMK Pro shopping page and no product matching the source scenario's near-five-star, thousands-of-ratings premise. The closest budget mechanical record is the $32 Punkston TK87 at 87/100 over 11 reviews; the only captured 100/100 mechanical record has just 2 reviews and costs $138.99; the hot-swappable RK100 is 77/100 over 12 reviews. None supplies product-specific longitudinal chatter or warranty evidence."
